  "definition": "Proposal for Water Quality Sampling Program",
  "effectiveDate": "2016-04-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at part heading for Env-Dw 305) #9007, eff 10-19-07, ss by #11062, eff 4-1-16 (See Revision Note #2 at part heading for Env-Dw 305)",
